---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/arrivals-hourly-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/arrivals-hourly-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="A spike, a quiet stretch, then a second wave"
  caption="Applications per hour, counted from when the roles went up."
>
  Bar chart of applications per hour for the first 32 hours. The second hour is the peak at 92. Arrivals fall to between 7 and 20 an hour for about fourteen hours, then a second wave of 36 to 47 an hour starts 20 hours in and lasts about four hours before tapering to single digits.
</Chart>
